# IMMUTABLE CONSTITUTIONAL CORE (L2.8a): the organism may amend its own constitution, so five
# clauses are SHA-256 sealed against it -- L1.1 (the objective function), L1.2 (the hierarchy),
# L1.6 (never-loosen validation + the two-stage law), L1.23 (survival rails, Tier-3), and L2.8a
